Stages re-merged with the exploratory E1-family analyses (WS1a): explore_* blocks added to the development, orphan-development, test, replication, block C and gemma M2 E1 analyses (every registered field is unchanged; the development stages also gain the earlier exploratory explore_D_effect_repair_* contrasts), new stages for the fifteen short worlds and for the cross-stage analyses (out-of-sample test, replication accounting, short-world prediction, cost model, noise floor)

